From 5e99cca45844d1818e75a3ffe65038fbe88a1958 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 44/58] transports: the dial and the close of v2ray transports

A failed HTTP/2 dial frees the handshake write with its error; QUIC streams and gRPC lite wait for
data without a buffer; the end of the dial context reaches the upgrade of websocket and httpupgrade;
Close of a client transport is a reset.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  b5741cbee transport: a failed HTTP/2 dial frees the handshake write, with its error
  8e451cdf5 readwait: wait for data without a buffer on QUIC streams and gRPC lite
  934a0d2cb v2ray: state and test that Close of a client transport is a reset
  7e0d5bf4a v2ray websocket, httpupgrade: the end of the dial context reaches the upgrade

Pdk-Feature: transport
Pdk-Zone: protocols
Pdk-Layer: 04
